Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:03.85,EN,,0,0,0,,In composition, two contributions\Nformed a common product.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.97,0:00:07.35,EN,,0,0,0,,That product was used in another\Ninteraction within the same world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:10.23,EN,,0,0,0,,The case combines a history\Nof order and contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.44,0:00:13.34,EN,,0,0,0,,Removing one contribution\Nchanges the consequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.42,0:00:17.96,EN,,0,0,0,,In this way, earlier relations\Nproduce results that can be reused.
